comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-29T14:54:09.941Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete 2840-item all-status corpus, exact title scan, and prior closed omission/get owners pm-p258tx, pm-y4z5, pm-b1w8vr, pm-4fwgaz reviewed. This is a distinct published 2026.9.29 leaf-materiality regression. The main checkout itself reproduces a false children omission on closed leaf pm-vks66s. No duplicate active owner found."
  "2026-09-29T14:55:27.573Z","harness:codex","Test-audit contract: omission receipts must describe restorable material. A leaf with zero children must have no children omission; a parent with a child must still advertise the group when withheld. Extend the existing SDK output-projection test with real temporary persistence; run it red against current code, then green after the SDK change. CLI get/show/read acceptance will exercise transport aliases separately. No production test seam or duplicate fixture."
  "2026-09-29T14:58:07.487Z","harness:codex","Red phase: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/sdk/output-projection.spec.ts exited 1 with the new real-tracker leaf full assertion: expected has_omissions=false, received true. Existing five tests passed. The current get implementation bypasses corpus scans for Task reads by design; the repair will derive children materiality from an available rollup and retain a conservative hint only for container types before their rollup is requested."
  "2026-09-29T16:08:29.797Z","harness:codex","Graph audit evidence: the current SDK regressions verify the prior omission-receipt contract (pm-p258tx), populated parent and scan-free built-in leaf child projection (pm-y4z5), empty-versus-unprojected collection distinction (pm-b1w8vr), and explicit requested-empty collection behavior (pm-4fwgaz). The live pm-vks66s leaf was the confirming tracker sample, recorded as discovered_from rather than a causal dependency. These five typed edges close the five new prose-reference gaps without changing the historical graph ceiling."
  "2026-09-29T16:16:32.109Z","harness:codex","Green and acceptance evidence 2026-09-29: linked SDK output projection and CLI/SDK parity tests passed in isolated tracker contexts (pm test run test-local-mumvn0ug-8pk4ug); canonical full suite passed 9,433 tests with 2 Windows-only skips and exact 100/100/100/100 all-source coverage. Final packed tarball SHA-256 f950a566da4691af29c38c065e0d0377ad2623616998acc0f763216daaf8eb7f under Bun 1.3.5 public SDK runGet reports a zero-child full leaf with has_omissions=false and its Epic parent with children.count=1. Earlier same-source packed CLI get/show/read full all reported no false child omission, while brief parent retained --fields children recovery. Published 2026.9.29 data remained readable with valid history. Full static chain awaits final rerun after tracker closure."
